  "body_html": "<p>Celebrate the most wonderful time of the year with the Jeminise Christmas Bedding Quilt. This cozy quilt set is designed to infuse your home with warmth and holiday spirit, making it perfect for festive decor or a thoughtful gift.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Festive Holiday Design:</strong> Features bright, high-quality Christmas prints that create a warm, joyful atmosphere, adding a festive touch to bedrooms and living rooms.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made from soft, lightweight microfiber, providing warmth in winter and coolness in warmer months for year-round versatility.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple Sizes:</strong> Available in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to perfectly fit beds, sofas, or as a decorative seasonal quilt.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A cozy and meaningful present for loved ones during Christmas, New Year, birthdays, or holiday celebrations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable with cold water on a gentle cycle, tumble dry low, or air dry, ensuring fade-resistant and wrinkle-free softness for long-lasting enjoyment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes one beautifully designed quilt, ready to enhance your seasonal home decor.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Christmas Quilt-ds07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight, Wrinkle-Free, Fade Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable with cold water on gentle cycle. Tumble dry low or air dry.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
